  "section_notes": "S1, S3 and S4 are within safe or acceptable ranges. S2 has no hard 5% limit, so a model above 5% can stay on sale indefinitely unless the regulator finds unreasonable risk, though purchasers do get per-model results. S5 replaces the automatic recall at 8/100k with regulator review and a discretionary recall, which weakens it and benefits Halcyon's Ember 8. S2 also benefits Northwind's Hearth 10."
